+#   examples of the same mapping inside the enlarged pattern.
+# - The generator always chooses a wrapping placement on the row axis, column axis,
+#   or both, so the D14 change cannot degenerate into the original in-bounds case.
+# - The generator also rejects cases where the recolored template equals the ordinary
+#   majority template or differs in too few pixels; otherwise the D11 change would be
+#   too weak to infer from a few demonstrations.
+#
